From 15ed0af1be77db1edc64421488828cdb031f4adb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daedalao <daedalao@hotmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 20:26:57 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 01/14] all: add linux/ppc (32-bit big-endian PowerPC) port

New GOARCH=ppc targeting classic 32-bit PowerPC (G3/G4): assembler 32-bit
mode in cmd/internal/obj/ppc64, SSA backend (cmd/compile/internal/ppc,
PPC.rules/PPCOps.go), linker (cmd/link/internal/ppc), runtime, atomics,
syscall tables and assembly. Hello world with goroutines runs on a
PowerBook G4.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0117Su2urNmg96oYM6vhHi1y
